{% doc %}
  Frequently asked questions for Signs ByLITA. Also replaces the old returns page.
{% enddoc %}
<article class="sbl-info">
  {% render 'sbl-info-hero',
    eyebrow: 'Support',
    title: 'Frequently asked questions',
    text: "Got questions? We've got answers. If you don't see what you're looking for, reach out — we're happy to help.",
    aside_label: '',
    aside_text: ''
  %}
  <div class="sbl-info-body">
    <nav class="sbl-info-jump" aria-label="Question topics">
      <a href="#ordering">Ordering</a>
      <a href="#designing">Designing your sign</a>
      <a href="#sizes">Sizes, shapes and mounting</a>
      <a href="#pricing">Pricing and payment</a>
      <a href="#production">Production and shipping</a>
      <a href="#returns">Returns and exchanges</a>
    </nav>

    <h2 id="ordering">Ordering and minimums</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Is there a minimum order?</h3>
      <p>No minimum. Order one sign or a whole building's worth — we handle both.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I order several signs with different wording in one go?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Design one sign, then use the bulk option in the sign designer to duplicate it and change only the wording — perfect for room numbers, office names and matching sets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I order signs for a whole building or several locations?</h3>
      <p>Absolutely. For large sets, matching finishes across sites or scheduled deliveries, request a bulk quote and a real person will review your order and come back with pricing and lead time.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I reorder a sign I bought before?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Contact us with your previous order number and we'll make it again to match — or tell us what you'd like changed.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I see my sign before I order?</h3>
      <p>Yes. The sign designer shows a live preview of your exact wording, shape, size and colors before you add it to your cart. What you see is what we make.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="designing">Designing your sign</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Do I need design skills or software?</h3>
      <p>Not at all. Pick a shape, type your wording, choose your colors and size — the sign designer does the rest. No design programs, no files to send.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Do you charge artwork or setup fees?</h3>
      <p>No. There are no artwork fees, setup fees or hidden charges. You pay for your signs — that's it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I add a logo or icon?</h3>
      <p>The sign designer includes a library of common icons (restroom, accessibility, arrows, no smoking and more). For your own logo, contact us and we'll help you get it on your sign.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>I can't find the wording I need in your ready-made signs.</h3>
      <p>That's what the sign designer is for. Any wording, any of our shapes and colors — design your own sign in a few minutes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can you make a desk sign or nameplate with my name and title?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Choose from our desk sign styles and holders (black, silver, gold and rose gold) and add any name and title.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="sizes">Sizes, shapes and mounting</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>What shapes and sizes are available?</h3>
      <p>Our signs come in a range of shapes — including Classic Framed, Standard, Fancy, Designer, Victorian, Oval, Circle, Square and Portrait Round — usually in small, medium and large sizes. Exact sizes are listed on each product and in the sign designer.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>How do I put my sign up?</h3>
      <p>Most of our wall and door signs come ready to mount with adhesive backing, so they go up in seconds on doors, walls and most smooth surfaces — no tools needed. Hanging and table signs include their twine or stand.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I use my sign outdoors?</h3>
      <p>Many of our signs are suitable for outdoor use. Check the product description, or contact us and we'll recommend the right option for your space.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Will the colors look exactly like my screen?</h3>
      <p>We match colors as closely as possible, but every screen displays color a little differently, so there may be slight variation between your preview and the finished sign.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="pricing">Pricing and payment</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Do you offer volume pricing?</h3>
      <p>Yes. For larger orders, request a bulk quote and we'll come back with volume pricing — usually the same business day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Are there any hidden fees?</h3>
      <p>No. The price you see is the price you pay. Shipping is shown before you pay at checkout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>What payment methods do you accept?</h3>
      <p>We accept all major credit and debit cards, Shop Pay, PayPal and Google Pay at checkout.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can businesses, schools or churches pay by invoice?</h3>
      <p>For qualifying bulk orders, contact us to discuss invoicing and purchase orders.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="production">Production and shipping</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>How long does production take?</h3>
      <p>Most orders are customized and shipped within 2 business days. Ready-made signs often ship the same day.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>How long does shipping take?</h3>
      <p>Standard delivery is usually 3–5 business days after your order ships. Expedited and overnight options are available at checkout. See <a href="/pages/shipping-delivery">Shipping &amp; Delivery</a> for details.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Do you ship internationally?</h3>
      <p>We currently ship within the United States only. Contact us if you have international needs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>How will I know when my order ships?</h3>
      <p>You'll get a shipping confirmation email with tracking as soon as your order leaves our facility.</p>
    </div>

    <h2 id="returns">Returns and exchanges</h2>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I return a custom sign?</h3>
      <p>Because custom signs, desk signs and plaques are made to order with your wording, we can't accept returns on them unless they arrive damaged or with an error on our part. Please check your spelling and preview carefully before you order.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I return a ready-made sign?</h3>
      <p>Yes. Ready-made (non-personalized) signs can be returned or exchanged within 30 days of delivery if they're unused and in their original packaging. Contact us to start a return and we'll send you instructions. Once we receive and check the item, we'll refund you to your original payment method. Return shipping is paid by the customer unless the item arrived damaged or incorrect.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>What if my order arrives damaged or with a mistake?</h3>
      <p>If something is wrong on our end, we'll replace it free of charge. Contact us within 7 days of delivery with a photo of the issue.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>What if I made a typo in my design?</h3>
      <p>Please double-check all wording before ordering — we make exactly what you design, so we can't replace signs for customer-entered errors. If you spot a mistake, contact us as soon as possible; if your order hasn't gone into production yet, we'll do our best to fix it.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="sbl-info-faq">
      <h3>Can I cancel or change my order?</h3>
      <p>Contact us as soon as possible. Because we start production quickly, we can only change or cancel orders that haven't been made yet.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="sbl-info-actions sbl-info-actions--faq">
      <span>Still have a question?</span>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--gold" href="/pages/contact-us">Contact Us</a>
      <a class="sbl-info-btn sbl-info-btn--outline" href="/products/custom-sign">Design Your Sign</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>
